WEBVTT

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.297
you know, nothing fancy, casual,

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.530
maybe with some Southern-style
food and some music."

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.563
She knew exactly what she wanted.

00:05:37.563 --> 00:05:39.263
She wanted a celebration.

00:05:41.697 --> 00:05:44.363
After a lot of tears and listening,

00:05:44.397 --> 00:05:47.963
hospice came in to consult
with us on next steps.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:53.330
And we learned that we needed
signatures from two doctors

00:05:53.363 --> 00:05:55.763
in order to proceed
with Death With Dignity.

00:05:57.063 --> 00:06:01.097
Her primary care physician
said he would sign,